    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stepping out of the loop\" ... that sounds so poetic, but what does that even look like in real life? it sounds like you're saying there's no way to actually fix things or stay in the world because the world won't let me in. are you saying the only way to have any power left is to just... give up on everything?",
